One cell-relaxation step of SnTe (LCAO, as relax_cell_vdw4_d4) with the rVV10 nonlocal correlation
(vdw_method rvv10, libvdwxc) on top of rPW86-PBE: energy, forces and stress through the LCAO grid.
Requires ENABLE_LIBXC and ENABLE_LIBVDWXC; listed in CASES_LIBVDWXC.txt. The reference was generated with 4 MPI
ranks.
